<title>USA: Furniture Brands names Wilbert Holliman CEO.</title>
<headline>Furniture Brands names Wilbert Holliman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furniture Brands International Inc said Wilbert Holliman was named president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Richard Loynd, who had been chief executive, president and chairman, will retain the title of chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>Holliman was formerly president of the company's Action Industries subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
